WEBVTT

00:05.000 --> 00:06.710
Classic of Mountains and Seas:

00:06.710 --> 00:07.710
The Great Wilderness West Classic
records

00:07.710 --> 00:09.310
there was a Kingdom of Women.

00:09.830 --> 00:11.670
The Great Tang Records on the Western
Regions further states

00:11.670 --> 00:14.240
in the Eastern Kingdom of Women,
women had always been the rulers.

00:14.240 --> 00:16.850
Men were only responsible for
warfare and farming.

00:16.850 --> 00:18.810
Later, it's unclear
in which country or era,

00:18.810 --> 00:21.170
the Rong Family migrated
and settled in Linji.

00:21.170 --> 00:23.130
They claimed to be descendants
of the Kingdom of Women.

00:23.130 --> 00:25.890
They cultivated tea plantations
to prosper the land,

00:25.890 --> 00:27.670
and also opened maritime trade routes.

00:27.670 --> 00:29.160
For over 400 years,

00:29.510 --> 00:30.920
their wealth overshadowed the realm,

00:30.920 --> 00:32.250
and their influence
rivaled that of feudal lords.

00:32.250 --> 00:35.250
Thus, they were known as
the Tea King, the Rong Family.

00:35.670 --> 00:38.150
Many talented men drawn by their fame,
married into the family,

00:38.150 --> 00:40.680
making it a remarkable spectacle
of the time.

00:57.430 --> 00:58.150
Let go of me.

00:59.070 --> 01:01.240
You're nothing but a dog
of the Rong Residence.

01:01.240 --> 01:02.300
What are you doing?

01:12.340 --> 01:14.610
[The oldest daughter of the Rong family,
Rong Shanbao]

01:16.000 --> 01:16.600
Miss Rong.

01:17.460 --> 01:18.789
It's that slut's fault!

01:18.870 --> 01:20.560
It was that slut who seduced me.

01:20.560 --> 01:21.640
She was the one who tempted me!

01:21.640 --> 01:22.700
It's all her fault.

01:22.800 --> 01:23.440
Mr. Wang,

01:25.010 --> 01:26.210
you've overstepped.

01:26.760 --> 01:27.360
Miss Rong!

01:28.250 --> 01:28.900
Miss Rong!

01:29.870 --> 01:30.480
Miss Rong!

01:33.590 --> 01:34.190
Miss Rong!

01:37.150 --> 01:38.479
[Butler, Cheng Guanyu]

01:41.840 --> 01:42.280
Bitch!

01:42.850 --> 01:43.680
You bitch!

01:44.200 --> 01:45.400
Why did you seduce me?

01:46.200 --> 01:47.400
Why did you seduce me?

01:48.170 --> 01:48.770
Miss Rong.

01:49.039 --> 01:50.300
This bitch seduced me.

01:50.789 --> 01:51.870
I was blinded.

01:52.789 --> 01:54.050
I'll never dare again!

01:54.350 --> 01:55.410
Please forgive me.

02:10.750 --> 02:11.590
You know,

02:13.150 --> 02:14.750
I've always been fond of you.

02:15.680 --> 02:17.450
After all, you are skilled in
poetry and writing,

02:17.450 --> 02:18.579
clever, adaptable,

02:19.630 --> 02:21.000
and considerate.

02:21.750 --> 02:22.350
Miss Rong.

02:24.000 --> 02:24.660
It was them!

02:25.630 --> 02:26.630
They framed me.

02:27.190 --> 02:28.650
They want to take my place!

02:28.750 --> 02:29.350
Miss Rong,

02:30.400 --> 02:32.800
we can't let this matter
ruin the affection

02:33.079 --> 02:35.079
we've shared all the time.

02:58.470 --> 03:00.400
Expel him from the Rong Residence.

03:15.870 --> 03:16.329
Come on.

03:17.630 --> 03:18.560
Don't be afraid.

03:24.520 --> 03:25.120
Yi,

03:26.520 --> 03:28.320
our Rong family has over 300 more

03:28.680 --> 03:29.680
tea plantations of this scale.

03:29.680 --> 03:30.710
in the south.

03:31.490 --> 03:33.950
The tea farmers we support
are beyond count.

03:34.230 --> 03:36.360
Only this newly opened plantation...

03:36.630 --> 03:38.829
All the precious tea transplanted here

03:39.079 --> 03:41.170
would wither within 3 months.

03:41.960 --> 03:43.090
It pains me greatly.

03:43.990 --> 03:45.460
I specifically brought you here
at great expense

03:45.460 --> 03:46.460
from Yunnan,

03:47.270 --> 03:50.200
so you could personally nurture the tea
from your homeland.

03:50.200 --> 03:51.260
I am relying on you.

03:54.829 --> 03:55.430
Miss Rong.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.190
Mr. Wang was chosen for you

03:57.190 --> 03:58.150
by the Old Madam.

03:58.560 --> 03:59.420
I free so sorry.

03:59.750 --> 04:01.210
I submit to your judgment.

04:01.910 --> 04:03.190
He has a low character.

04:03.930 --> 04:05.190
Let's not speak of him.

04:05.780 --> 04:08.070
Since ancient times,
fine swords are gifted to heroes.

04:08.070 --> 04:09.800
From now on, whoever you fancy,

04:10.000 --> 04:11.520
or whatever treasure you desire,

04:11.520 --> 04:12.430
just tell me.

04:13.150 --> 04:14.810
Take good care of my tea for me.

04:16.310 --> 04:17.190
I will grant

04:17.810 --> 04:18.890
all your wishes.

04:19.950 --> 04:22.150
I'm willing to serve you.

04:23.120 --> 04:24.780
I would do everything for you.

04:25.220 --> 04:27.220
Yi, look.

04:45.100 --> 04:47.540
Tea is our lifeblood.

04:48.720 --> 04:49.850
Within three years,

04:51.040 --> 04:52.900
I want every barren mountain here

04:53.920 --> 04:55.120
to become a sea of tea.

05:10.080 --> 05:13.720
[Glory]

05:14.590 --> 05:15.800
[Three years later]

05:22.750 --> 05:23.410
Be careful.

05:39.510 --> 05:40.970
Heavy snow is coming soon.

05:41.000 --> 05:42.130
-Granny.
-Hurry up.

05:42.920 --> 05:43.380
Granny!

05:45.800 --> 05:46.360
Granny!

05:48.510 --> 05:49.120
Granny!

05:50.430 --> 05:51.560
Are you okay, Ma'am?

05:52.630 --> 05:53.760
Quick, get up first.

05:59.360 --> 06:00.000
Here are you.

06:00.000 --> 06:00.830
Thank you.

06:01.270 --> 06:01.870
Excuse me,

06:02.390 --> 06:03.720
how to get to Linji City?

06:04.240 --> 06:06.240
Miss, that's still a long way off.

06:07.070 --> 06:09.000
Looks like heavy snow is about to hit.

06:09.000 --> 06:10.120
You can't travel now.

06:10.120 --> 06:10.850
Why don't you

06:11.000 --> 06:12.680
come into my shop for a cup of hot tea

06:12.680 --> 06:14.480
and wait until the storm passes?

06:17.510 --> 06:18.570
Come inside first.

06:19.120 --> 06:20.430
It's freezing cold out here.

06:20.430 --> 06:21.600
You'll freeze

06:21.600 --> 06:22.390
to death!

06:23.680 --> 06:24.600
Thank you.

06:41.090 --> 06:43.650
[Zhang's Tea Shop]

07:55.920 --> 07:57.040
He's so heavy.

08:38.940 --> 08:41.789
[Lu Jianglai]

08:46.080 --> 08:46.550
Tell me.

08:47.270 --> 08:49.400
Where are the kidnapped women hiding?

09:46.550 --> 09:47.670
Constable Liu!

09:48.600 --> 09:49.460
Bandit is here!

09:49.750 --> 09:50.390
Go get him!

09:51.540 --> 09:52.400
Bandit is here?

09:53.080 --> 09:53.750
Who dares

09:53.750 --> 09:54.880
cause trouble here?

09:55.180 --> 09:56.310
Come out and face me!

10:02.850 --> 10:03.710
Constable Liu.

10:05.090 --> 10:07.630
You must be tired
from patrolling late at night.

10:07.630 --> 10:08.360
Lord Lu?

10:12.700 --> 10:13.370
Lord Lu,

10:13.390 --> 10:14.340
why are you here?

10:14.530 --> 10:16.390
I'm visiting incognito tonight.

10:16.850 --> 10:18.550
I’ve already identified the suspect

10:18.550 --> 10:21.410
in the case of the missing women
in Chunning County.

10:25.430 --> 10:26.550
Arrest him now!

10:28.150 --> 10:28.680
Yes, sir!

10:32.000 --> 10:32.660
Arrest him!

10:34.280 --> 10:35.890
Quickly return to the county office,

10:35.890 --> 10:38.750
and fetch the official sedan
to escort Lord Lu back.

10:41.070 --> 10:41.600
Let's go.

10:53.800 --> 10:56.130
Congratulations, My Lord.

10:56.510 --> 10:58.720
My Lord, you are so wise

10:58.720 --> 10:59.850
and have foresight.

10:59.890 --> 11:02.120
You solved such a major case
so soon after taking office.

11:02.120 --> 11:04.380
A promotion
is surely just around the corner!

11:04.380 --> 11:06.020
It's mainly my fault.

11:06.050 --> 11:07.750
I was negligent in handling the case,

11:07.750 --> 11:09.270
forcing you
to take such a risk alone.

11:09.270 --> 11:11.240
I truly deserve ten thousand deaths.

11:11.240 --> 11:12.840
I beg your forgiveness.

11:17.870 --> 11:18.390
Liu Ben!

11:19.480 --> 11:21.000
You lead the county's public servants,

11:21.000 --> 11:22.810
feed on the people's provisions,

11:22.810 --> 11:24.330
yet dare to collude with evildoers

11:24.330 --> 11:26.020
and plot against an imperial official?

11:26.020 --> 11:27.480
How many lives do you have?

11:30.360 --> 11:31.960
What do you mean?

11:32.140 --> 11:34.500
Your were too eager for merit

11:34.870 --> 11:36.000
and carelessly fell into
the trap of thieves.

11:36.000 --> 11:37.630
That's why you lost your life.

11:37.630 --> 11:38.600
If you died,

11:39.000 --> 11:40.080
the great credit
for solving this major case

11:40.080 --> 11:41.340
would land right on me.

11:42.200 --> 11:44.240
Anyway, I have to thank you

11:44.510 --> 11:45.480
for giving me

11:45.480 --> 11:46.910
this colossal fortune.

11:47.910 --> 11:48.390
Men!

11:52.870 --> 11:55.200
Let's see Lord Lu off
on his final journey.

12:17.400 --> 12:18.530
Greetings, My Lord.

12:20.390 --> 12:21.390
Who told you

12:21.520 --> 12:23.200
our lord risked his life alone?

12:22.560 --> 12:23.430
[Private Advisor, Feng Zhusheng]

12:32.390 --> 12:33.190
Take him down.

13:39.290 --> 13:40.350
There's one more here.

13:40.350 --> 13:41.150
Take her back.

13:47.840 --> 13:49.640
My Lord, they're locked up here.

13:50.510 --> 13:52.390
They're officials! We're saved!

13:54.150 --> 13:54.910
Help us!

13:56.840 --> 13:58.910
Hurry up. Let's go.

13:59.440 --> 14:00.670
Let's go. Thank you.

14:04.150 --> 14:05.000
We're saved.

14:23.550 --> 14:24.010
My Lord,

14:24.440 --> 14:26.090
many are girls from other places,

14:26.090 --> 14:27.960
on their way to the mountains to pick tea.

14:27.960 --> 14:30.270
Take them back to the county office
to register.

14:30.270 --> 14:32.120
Then notify their respective families

14:32.120 --> 14:33.090
to come claim them and close the cases.

14:33.090 --> 14:33.620
Yes, sir!

14:34.490 --> 14:35.690
Did you all hear that?

14:35.910 --> 14:37.440
Lord Lu is sending you home.

14:37.600 --> 14:40.580
Thank you, My Lord!

14:40.600 --> 14:41.960
For those with no family to claim them,

14:41.960 --> 14:44.220
arrange temporary
shelter at the County Office first.

14:44.220 --> 14:46.120
As for the woman who voluntarily
served as bait tonight,

14:46.120 --> 14:47.280
reward her with five taels of silver.

14:47.280 --> 14:47.810
Yes, sir!

14:50.550 --> 14:51.510
We can finally go home.

14:51.510 --> 14:52.750
Yes, we can go now.

14:52.980 --> 14:53.510
Let's go.

14:55.150 --> 14:56.270
Be careful.

15:39.520 --> 15:39.980
My Lord.

15:41.740 --> 15:42.200
My Lord.

15:42.370 --> 15:44.430
Another cellar has been discovered.

15:55.150 --> 15:57.000
Dead bodies... piled to the top.

16:06.240 --> 16:07.000
Corpse mud?

16:07.720 --> 16:10.200
It's... it's corpse mud.

16:11.140 --> 16:13.100
Immediately dispatch more personnel.

16:13.100 --> 16:15.030
Gather all the county's coroners.

16:16.140 --> 16:18.090
I will interrogate through the night.

16:18.090 --> 16:18.620
Yes, sir!

16:38.910 --> 16:40.750
I beg Your Lord
to dismiss your attendants.

16:40.750 --> 16:42.950
I have confidential matters to report.

16:53.360 --> 16:53.890
Let's go.

16:57.220 --> 17:00.580
I've run rampant in Chunning for 20 years.

17:01.360 --> 17:02.200
Every county magistrate

17:02.200 --> 17:03.120
has treated me

17:03.120 --> 17:04.650
with courtesy and respect.

17:04.960 --> 17:07.440
Lord Lu,
you endured ten years of hard study

17:07.440 --> 17:09.510
to earn your rank and title.
It wasn't easy.

17:09.510 --> 17:10.550
Take my advice:

17:11.640 --> 17:13.109
don't dig your own grave

17:13.109 --> 17:14.480
and ruin your future.

17:15.200 --> 17:16.240
Release me now.

17:16.920 --> 17:19.119
It'll be more convenient for both of us.

17:20.440 --> 17:21.500
He was recommended

17:21.640 --> 17:22.900
by Prefect Xu of Linji.

17:26.829 --> 17:29.310
But with corpses piled like mountains,

17:30.350 --> 17:31.510
if I let you go,

17:31.880 --> 17:34.000
how can I explain myself to the Prefect?

17:34.000 --> 17:34.930
That's easy.

17:35.920 --> 17:37.200
He has told you

17:37.810 --> 17:41.200
that my sister is Lord Xu's

17:41.200 --> 17:42.880
most beloved concubine.

17:43.400 --> 17:44.130
To be honest,

17:44.480 --> 17:45.750
even if you arrest me,

17:46.000 --> 17:47.510
later you'll have to release me unharmed

17:47.510 --> 17:48.720
and send me back anyway.

17:48.720 --> 17:50.830
Why not just release me now?

17:51.110 --> 17:53.240
Later, I'll have a word
with my brother-in-law,

17:53.240 --> 17:54.000
Lord Xu.

17:54.400 --> 17:55.890
I'll put in a good word for you.

17:55.890 --> 17:56.550
Reporting!

18:22.240 --> 18:23.170
How dare you, Liu Ben!

18:23.170 --> 18:24.970
You dare to assassinate Lord Lu!

18:25.470 --> 18:26.880
-My Lord!
-My Lord!

18:27.440 --> 18:29.040
Liu Ben seized a knife
with malicious intent.

18:29.040 --> 18:30.720
Fortunately, Lord Lu is blessed

18:30.720 --> 18:31.830
and didn't fall into his trap.

18:31.830 --> 18:33.630
He has been executed on the spot.

18:33.880 --> 18:34.720
We are late.

18:35.550 --> 18:37.280
Sorry to let you be frightened.

18:37.310 --> 18:39.570
Carry the body back to the County Office.

18:39.960 --> 18:42.020
Hang it for public display for 3 days.

18:42.960 --> 18:44.640
I want everyone in Chunning County

18:44.640 --> 18:45.900
to see the fate of those

18:46.530 --> 18:47.930
who collude with bandits

18:48.350 --> 18:50.200
and prey upon the people.

18:51.030 --> 18:51.560
Yes, sir!

18:55.110 --> 18:56.510
Hurry up and support him!

19:07.920 --> 19:08.920
Serves him right!

19:09.240 --> 19:10.500
Instant retribution!

19:13.920 --> 19:16.540
[Rong Residence]

19:43.830 --> 19:45.270
It's all Lu's fault.

19:45.460 --> 19:46.860
If he hadn't interfered,

19:46.880 --> 19:48.590
you would have lured
the snake out of the hole,

19:48.590 --> 19:49.240
and captured the mastermind

19:49.240 --> 19:50.750
behind the abduction

19:50.750 --> 19:52.750
of the mountain tea-picking girls.

19:56.500 --> 19:58.900
This collusion between officials
and merchants has a long history.

19:58.900 --> 19:59.880
If they could truly follow
this trail

19:59.880 --> 20:01.340
and investigate further,

20:01.710 --> 20:02.790
it might not be a bad thing

20:02.790 --> 20:04.310
for the people.

20:05.780 --> 20:07.840
Look into this newly arrived
Lord Lu.

20:08.010 --> 20:08.380
Okay.

20:22.320 --> 20:23.030
Miss Rong,

20:23.960 --> 20:25.190
the wheel tracks leading down the mountain

20:25.190 --> 20:26.520
had been tampered with.

20:35.610 --> 20:37.010
Time to settle accounts.

20:43.700 --> 20:45.330
Did you see clearly? She's really back?

20:45.330 --> 20:46.330
Hurry up, please.

20:56.310 --> 20:58.760
[Young Master of the Rong family,
Rong Shanchang]

21:01.730 --> 21:03.100
Miss Rong.

21:04.130 --> 21:05.330
You're back already?

21:05.480 --> 21:05.880
But...

21:06.200 --> 21:07.600
Is the day not yet upon us?

21:08.440 --> 21:09.640
I had just descended Mount Guzhu

21:09.640 --> 21:11.410
when I encountered a landslide.

21:11.410 --> 21:13.570
Unfortunately, I then ran into bandits
robbing people.

21:13.570 --> 21:15.770
Not only did they
rob the wild tea seeds,

21:16.070 --> 21:18.290
they also tried to abduct
and sell my maidservants.

21:18.290 --> 21:20.220
So you don't know?

21:22.580 --> 21:24.790
You encountered a landslide on your way?

21:24.790 --> 21:26.550
How could you also have run into bandits?

21:26.550 --> 21:28.200
Did you get hurt?

21:28.590 --> 21:29.050
Sister.

21:37.400 --> 21:38.310
It was the Young Master

21:38.310 --> 21:39.720
who embezzled silver from the account.

21:39.720 --> 21:41.750
Fearing the truth would come out
during the audit in 7 days,

21:41.750 --> 21:42.480
and hearing that

21:42.480 --> 21:44.440
you had entered Mount Guzhu
to seek wild tea plants,

21:44.440 --> 21:45.400
he planned to delay you

21:45.400 --> 21:46.590
a couple of days on the road,

21:46.590 --> 21:48.410
so he'd have time
to make up the shortfall elsewhere.

21:48.410 --> 21:50.830
But... he only dared to
tamper with the wheel tracks!

21:50.830 --> 21:51.690
You scoundrel!

21:52.270 --> 21:53.590
Who told you to frame me?

21:53.590 --> 21:55.190
Would I harm my elder sister?

22:00.360 --> 22:01.960
Miss Rong, please see clearly!

22:01.960 --> 22:03.070
Miss Rong is wise.

22:03.510 --> 22:05.240
We truly tried to dissuade him!

22:05.240 --> 22:07.200
But Young Master didn't listen.

22:07.640 --> 22:08.170
Yes. Yes.

22:08.510 --> 22:10.350
How would we dare to kill people?

22:10.600 --> 22:12.300
Shut up!

22:16.440 --> 22:16.840
Get up!

22:16.940 --> 22:18.370
I am the eldest son of the main branch.

22:18.370 --> 22:18.810
Let's go.

22:18.810 --> 22:20.160
Who dares to touch me?

22:20.250 --> 22:21.220
Just try.

22:22.030 --> 22:23.030
You may leave now.

22:29.000 --> 22:29.860
My dear sister,

22:30.530 --> 22:31.720
it's just a few

22:31.720 --> 22:32.920
lowly dogs that died.

22:33.290 --> 22:33.890
Tomorrow,

22:34.120 --> 22:35.780
I'll get you a few better ones.

22:36.200 --> 22:36.830
Okay?

22:41.230 --> 22:42.880
You treated human life
as worthless grass,

22:42.880 --> 22:44.010
being so heartless.

22:44.790 --> 22:46.980
Just a few servants.

22:48.400 --> 22:50.800
You were blinded by profit and insatiable,

22:55.750 --> 22:58.120
plotting against superiors,
showing no respect for elders.

22:58.120 --> 22:59.270
Such injustice!

22:59.430 --> 23:00.680
I swear to the heavens,

23:00.680 --> 23:02.350
I only tampered with the wheel tracks!

23:02.350 --> 23:04.080
What landslide and bandits...

23:04.400 --> 23:05.960
Even if you lent me
a hundred times the courage,

23:05.960 --> 23:07.030
I wouldn't dare!

23:09.260 --> 23:11.830
You should be glad
you only tampered with the wheel tracks.

23:11.830 --> 23:12.880
Otherwise,

23:13.550 --> 23:14.970
by this time next year,
the weeds on your grave

23:14.970 --> 23:16.100
might be 3 feet high.

23:17.010 --> 23:18.780
Kneel outside the ancestral hall
for 7 days.

23:18.780 --> 23:20.440
No one is to bring him any food.

23:35.860 --> 23:37.530
My dear brother, get up please.

23:37.530 --> 23:38.590
The ground is cold.

23:39.910 --> 23:41.780
Every one looks down on me!

23:42.160 --> 23:42.960
You know my luck in this life

23:42.960 --> 23:44.550
has never been good...

23:45.070 --> 23:46.270
Don't say that again.

23:46.400 --> 23:47.670
Although we are family,

23:47.670 --> 23:48.870
there is closeness and distance.

23:47.750 --> 23:50.940
[The third daughter of the Rong family,
Rong Yun'e]

23:49.350 --> 23:50.240
No one can compare to the one

23:50.240 --> 23:51.790
who is the very apple of Grandma's eye.

23:51.790 --> 23:52.750
Only after Father pleaded repeatedly

23:52.750 --> 23:53.440
could we follow her

23:53.440 --> 23:54.970
in using
the generational name character.

23:54.970 --> 23:55.970
She is the moon in the clouds,

23:55.970 --> 23:57.550
but you are the mud underfoot.

23:57.550 --> 23:58.550
Just bear with it.

23:58.550 --> 23:59.270
Coward!

23:59.790 --> 24:02.000
The rain on the eaves' plantains
won't kill you.

24:02.000 --> 24:03.270
All of you are afraid of her,

24:03.270 --> 24:04.070
but I'm not.

24:04.830 --> 24:05.890
Sooner or later...

24:10.040 --> 24:11.170
Greetings, Ms. Yan.

24:11.950 --> 24:14.050
Lady Rong has already given the order:

24:14.050 --> 24:15.780
Miss Rong's status is exalted.

24:15.880 --> 24:17.230
Anyone who dares to
challenge her authority,

24:17.230 --> 24:18.230
disregarding rank and propriety,

24:17.780 --> 24:21.180
[Butler, Yan Jingyi]

24:18.830 --> 24:20.190
will be expelled from the Rong family.

24:20.190 --> 24:22.000
Their life or death
will no longer be our concern.

24:22.000 --> 24:23.270
As for those in this courtyard

24:23.270 --> 24:24.700
who plot misconduct
or know but fail to report it,

24:24.700 --> 24:26.230
give them 80 heavy strokes.

24:26.420 --> 24:28.680
Then, deliver them
to the County Office.

24:31.850 --> 24:33.250
As for you, Young Master,

24:33.670 --> 24:35.650
since Miss Rong has already
decided your punishment,

24:35.650 --> 24:36.510
you can just go kneel

24:36.510 --> 24:38.640
outside the ancestral hall yourself.

24:48.500 --> 24:50.720
[Governor's Office]

24:51.790 --> 24:53.110
A mere county magistrate

24:53.110 --> 24:55.110
dares to execute my wife's brother?

24:55.240 --> 24:56.160
Your Excellency,

24:56.160 --> 24:57.890
you must uphold justice for me!

24:58.350 --> 24:59.590
Your Excellency, I'm
the Chunning Magistrate,

24:59.590 --> 25:01.720
Lu Jianglai, request an audience now.

25:02.830 --> 25:03.770
[Governor, Jiang Yiqian]

25:07.750 --> 25:09.410
Greetings, Your Excellency.

25:10.920 --> 25:12.030
Lord Xu, you're here, too.

25:11.230 --> 25:13.270
[Prefect, Xu Song]

25:14.150 --> 25:15.150
Have you

25:15.170 --> 25:16.770
received the letter so soon?

25:17.940 --> 25:19.610
It's all that damned Liu Ben's fault!

25:19.610 --> 25:20.890
Having received your
great kindness and favor,

25:20.890 --> 25:22.160
he should have been
diligent and conscientious,

25:22.160 --> 25:22.920
striving in his duties.

25:22.920 --> 25:24.070
Yet he betrayed that kindness,

25:24.070 --> 25:24.880
forgot righteousness,
acted wildly and irrationally,

25:24.880 --> 25:26.860
and slandered you
as the chief bandit!

25:26.860 --> 25:27.720
He also said...

25:29.790 --> 25:30.650
What did he say?

25:30.920 --> 25:33.200
I dare not say it.

25:33.200 --> 25:33.790
Tell me.

25:33.950 --> 25:34.680
He said last year,

25:34.680 --> 25:35.550
he presented you with a pair of

25:35.550 --> 25:37.160
priceless cricket pots,

25:37.330 --> 25:38.310
30 jars of Huadiao wine,

25:38.310 --> 25:39.710
10 kilos of Longjing tea.

25:39.730 --> 25:40.700
For your concubine's birthday,

25:40.700 --> 25:42.220
he gave 500 taels in silver

25:43.200 --> 25:44.830
and sent you a theater troupe
for 3 days.

25:44.830 --> 25:46.000
Nonsense!

25:46.200 --> 25:47.000
Yes.

25:47.000 --> 25:48.550
I also angrily rebuked him:

25:48.750 --> 25:49.590
"Lord Xu has noble character

25:49.590 --> 25:51.960
and is extremely strict with
his subordinates."

25:51.960 --> 25:53.070
Last time I visited the Xu residence,

25:53.070 --> 25:54.160
you didn't even accept
a single tael's worth of gifts

25:54.160 --> 25:55.020
or gatekeeper's tips!

25:55.020 --> 25:57.160
How could you possibly
covet his petty offerings?

25:57.160 --> 25:57.790
But he, on the contrary,

25:57.790 --> 25:59.160
started shouting even louder!

25:59.160 --> 26:01.160
He said half of Liujia Village

26:01.160 --> 26:02.070
works in the County Office,

26:02.070 --> 26:02.920
all relying on

26:02.920 --> 26:04.740
Lord Xu's numerous promotions and support!

26:04.740 --> 26:05.600
He also said...

26:11.550 --> 26:12.920
you had taken a fancy

26:12.920 --> 26:14.440
to the daughter of retired Censor Fang

26:14.440 --> 26:15.960
and wanted to kidnap her
to be your concubine!

26:15.960 --> 26:17.160
Nonsense!

26:19.070 --> 26:21.240
l was precisely acting with urgency

26:21.350 --> 26:22.790
for your concerns.

26:23.030 --> 26:24.830
I feared that in open court,
his foul words

26:24.830 --> 26:26.070
would slander your
clean reputation.

26:26.070 --> 26:27.270
Once it spread publicly,

26:27.270 --> 26:29.070
where would official dignity remain?

26:29.070 --> 26:31.270
That's why it was a last resort

26:31.720 --> 26:33.180
to execute him on the spot.

26:35.920 --> 26:38.110
I believe you will surely forgive me.

26:38.350 --> 26:38.830
You...

26:45.400 --> 26:46.530
I'be been impudent.

26:46.590 --> 26:47.660
I beg Your Excellency's forgiveness.

26:47.660 --> 26:49.480
I will return right away
and investigate strictly.

26:49.480 --> 26:50.920
If there truly is someone spreading rumors

26:50.920 --> 26:52.380
and confusing the public,

26:52.640 --> 26:53.680
l will surely

26:53.680 --> 26:55.210
dismember his bones alive!

26:55.590 --> 26:56.350
Alright.

26:56.590 --> 26:57.160
I know.

26:57.880 --> 26:58.680
You may leave.

26:59.350 --> 27:00.550
I shall take my leave.

27:10.750 --> 27:11.750
Your Excellency,

27:11.790 --> 27:12.790
Zhang's Tea Shop

27:13.350 --> 27:15.550
has already yielded countless skeletons.

27:15.550 --> 27:17.680
Without severe punishment,
it'll be hard to appease public anger.

27:17.680 --> 27:18.400
I think...

27:19.450 --> 27:20.340
This is not why

27:20.750 --> 27:21.950
I have called for you.

27:24.800 --> 27:26.320
This Chunhua Ge Tie...

27:26.510 --> 27:28.440
I've looked through it many times.

27:28.510 --> 27:29.510
I really

27:30.720 --> 27:31.890
can't put it down.

27:32.810 --> 27:34.110
But now,

27:34.910 --> 27:36.510
I should return it to its owner.

27:36.510 --> 27:38.220
[Volume VIII of the Chunhua Ge Tie]

27:36.960 --> 27:37.750
Take it back.

27:38.550 --> 27:39.510
This is merely a copy

27:39.510 --> 27:40.840
I made on a whim,
practicing my skills.

27:40.840 --> 27:42.420
I fear it would make people laugh.

27:42.420 --> 27:43.890
It's my pleasure

27:44.400 --> 27:47.400
that Your Excellency
deigns to keep it for enjoyment.

27:48.760 --> 27:50.330
Really? I didn't tell

27:51.190 --> 27:52.190
this is a copy.

27:53.460 --> 27:54.950
I couldn't tell at all.

27:56.220 --> 27:58.060
The younger generation is formidable,

27:58.060 --> 27:59.170
truly formidable.

28:00.420 --> 28:02.250
However, as an official,

28:02.750 --> 28:04.150
you should also remember

28:04.170 --> 28:05.830
an old saying in officialdom:

28:06.440 --> 28:08.190
"For those
who do not wish for great darkness,

28:08.190 --> 28:10.520
they must not be too stubbornly upright."

28:10.730 --> 28:12.750
Everyone will be someone's successor,

28:12.750 --> 28:14.790
and everyone also
was someone's predecessor.

28:14.790 --> 28:16.680
When doing things,
always leave a bit of leeway,

28:16.680 --> 28:18.810
and be more considerate of the dignity

28:19.000 --> 28:20.660
of superiors and colleagues.

28:21.030 --> 28:22.030
As the saying goes,

28:22.030 --> 28:24.400
"Harmony up and down, all in unity,"

28:24.850 --> 28:26.910
then everyone can do their work well.

28:28.700 --> 28:30.150
Thank you for your instruction,
Your Excellency.

28:30.150 --> 28:32.300
I will surely remember it in my heart.

28:42.890 --> 28:49.140
[Governor's Office]

28:47.960 --> 28:48.420
My Lord,

28:49.730 --> 28:51.060
where are we going next?

28:51.290 --> 28:52.550
Back to the residence.

28:58.340 --> 28:59.250
What an old fox.

29:09.150 --> 29:10.560
Relying on Minister Xu
in the capital

29:10.560 --> 29:11.760
as his examiner,

29:12.440 --> 29:14.350
and the Emperor favoring his writings,

29:14.350 --> 29:15.790
how arrogantly and presumptuously

29:15.790 --> 29:16.830
he has acted!

29:17.310 --> 29:19.480
He completely disregards me at all.

29:19.770 --> 29:21.770
A monkey sent from the capital

29:22.100 --> 29:22.810
still can't jump out
of the palm of

29:22.810 --> 29:23.890
your hand.

29:24.590 --> 29:26.400
Haven't you recently

29:26.400 --> 29:27.620
been troubled by
the old case of Wei family,

29:27.620 --> 29:29.400
urgently seeking capable officials

29:29.400 --> 29:30.640
to handle it?

29:31.790 --> 29:32.320
Well now,

29:32.830 --> 29:35.360
he's the perfect candidate
delivered to you.

29:39.610 --> 29:41.000
Raise the sedan!

29:56.210 --> 29:58.420
[Madam Rong]

30:00.540 --> 30:02.870
[Cousin of the Rong family,
Shen Xiangling]

30:06.350 --> 30:08.870
With sallow-dark face
and short eyebrows,

30:09.280 --> 30:11.740
how dare you
present yourself here to apply!

30:12.030 --> 30:13.270
Truly laughable!

30:15.400 --> 30:16.400
Miss Rong is back.

30:20.470 --> 30:21.730
Greetings, Miss Rong.

30:25.070 --> 30:27.110
All right, we've seen them now.

30:27.510 --> 30:28.640
All of you may leave.

30:32.270 --> 30:33.830
Bao, come here.

30:40.210 --> 30:42.870
Sisters having fun together
but didn't call me?

30:44.160 --> 30:46.160
Yunxi was afraid
you wouldn't make it in time,

30:46.160 --> 30:48.560
so she said
she'd screen them for you first.

30:57.510 --> 30:59.690
[The second daughter of the Rong family,
Rong Yunxi]

31:07.530 --> 31:09.460
What a rich, mellow tea fragrance.

31:10.750 --> 31:13.140
[The fifth daughter of the Rong family,
Rong Yunshu]

31:28.230 --> 31:29.350
Thank you, Yunxi.

31:30.350 --> 31:31.030
What a pity.

31:31.750 --> 31:33.160
The quality of those just now

31:33.160 --> 31:34.690
was all beyond redemption.

31:34.940 --> 31:36.350
Truly a waste of effort.

31:37.200 --> 31:39.050
Each family has sent over candidates.

31:39.050 --> 31:40.750
They'll arrive in Linji in a few days.

31:40.750 --> 31:42.550
There's no rush to make a choice.

31:43.160 --> 31:44.920
How was your trip?

31:53.340 --> 31:55.150
Thank you for your concern, Grandmother.

31:55.150 --> 31:57.370
We encountered a landslide
on our way back,

31:57.370 --> 31:58.500
and lost two guards.

31:59.440 --> 31:59.960
Really?

32:00.650 --> 32:01.720
Miss Rong said

32:01.950 --> 32:02.890
the best Zisun Tea

32:02.890 --> 32:04.240
is on Mount Guzhu.

32:04.760 --> 32:06.030
She also mentioned
that deep in the forest,

32:06.030 --> 32:08.200
there are hundred-year-old
wild mother tea trees.

32:08.200 --> 32:10.350
Grandmother placed great hopes
on your trip.

32:10.350 --> 32:11.840
She was just telling us earlier

32:11.840 --> 32:13.270
how she hoped for your early return,

32:13.270 --> 32:14.750
wishing for guests
at the New Year tea party

32:14.750 --> 32:15.790
to taste

32:15.790 --> 32:17.070
the wild Zisun Tea.

32:17.380 --> 32:18.580
What should we do now?

32:20.550 --> 32:21.270
Yunshu.

32:22.230 --> 32:23.680
The most important thing

32:23.700 --> 32:25.100
is Miss Rong safe return.

32:25.510 --> 32:26.940
The family of the deceased and injured

32:26.940 --> 32:28.840
should also be properly comforted.

32:28.840 --> 32:30.570
With the New Year approaching,

32:30.970 --> 32:32.730
we must avoid any incidents.

32:34.400 --> 32:36.300
No wonder everyone praises
for your virtue.

32:36.300 --> 32:38.160
Truly accustomed to being the good person,

32:38.160 --> 32:39.680
being so considerate.

32:39.810 --> 32:41.140
We could never compare.

32:42.070 --> 32:44.400
But Mount Guzhu

32:44.400 --> 32:45.920
has always been peaceful.

32:46.320 --> 32:47.490
Who knows if someone

32:47.520 --> 32:48.720
secretly tracked her movements,

32:48.720 --> 32:50.980
intentionally targeting the Rong family?

32:50.980 --> 32:51.940
In my opinion,

32:51.960 --> 32:53.920
comforting the families
of the deceased is important,

32:53.920 --> 32:55.780
but uncovering the source of this trouble

32:55.780 --> 32:56.910
is the most crucial.

33:07.640 --> 33:08.470
Exactly!

33:09.230 --> 33:10.510
That mountain path didn't collapse

33:10.510 --> 33:11.510
earlier or later,

33:11.880 --> 33:13.750
but just as Shanbao's carriage passed,

33:13.750 --> 33:15.480
with a rumble, it collapsed.

33:16.270 --> 33:17.400
You must be careful.

33:17.710 --> 33:18.230
You'd better go to the temple

33:18.230 --> 33:19.560
to change your fortune.

33:21.220 --> 33:23.710
[The fourth daughter of the Rong family, Rong Yunyin]

33:34.590 --> 33:36.000
Greetings, Grandmother.

33:36.000 --> 33:37.090
Nice to meet you.

33:37.530 --> 33:38.960
No wonder that maid fanning

33:38.960 --> 33:40.480
looked familiar earlier.

33:40.690 --> 33:42.080
So it was you
deliberately dressed like that

33:42.080 --> 33:43.490
to play a trick.

33:43.750 --> 33:45.350
Only you could think of that.

33:55.490 --> 33:57.550
Making them drink scalding tea earlier

33:57.550 --> 33:59.180
was also your idea, wasn't it?

33:59.180 --> 34:00.250
Grandmother.

34:00.490 --> 34:01.310
I just want to

34:01.310 --> 34:02.650
share Shanbao's burden,

34:02.650 --> 34:05.250
afraid someone
might slip through unnoticed.

34:05.250 --> 34:07.450
You, always playing tricks on people.

34:07.760 --> 34:08.960
What can I do with you?

34:10.710 --> 34:12.100
Grandmother.

34:12.400 --> 34:14.330
Scalding tea is very troublesome.

34:14.840 --> 34:15.590
Yunxi

34:15.840 --> 34:17.750
insisted on
drying it over charcoal fire herself

34:17.750 --> 34:19.750
and got a huge scar on her right hand.

34:20.080 --> 34:21.810
Although I couldn't help much,

34:22.260 --> 34:23.280
serving tea personally

34:23.280 --> 34:25.139
is my way of showing filial piety.

34:26.280 --> 34:27.800
Your hand is scalded?

34:30.050 --> 34:31.310
It's nothing serious.

34:31.429 --> 34:32.889
Yunyin, young but shrewd,

34:32.969 --> 34:33.830
loves to boast.

34:34.150 --> 34:36.679
Don't talk nonsense
in front of Grandmother.

34:42.340 --> 34:43.139
Grandmother,

34:43.440 --> 34:45.300
do you think my tea brewing skills

34:45.590 --> 34:46.440
are up to par?

34:47.360 --> 34:49.820
During the new tea picking season
this year,

34:49.920 --> 34:51.670
let me go to the tea plantation too,

34:51.670 --> 34:52.230
alright?

34:52.670 --> 34:54.440
Please?

34:54.960 --> 34:56.230
Alright.

35:27.900 --> 35:29.900
Lapsang Souchong is hard to come by.

35:30.400 --> 35:31.930
To bring out its fragrance,

35:32.000 --> 35:33.800
one must not only practice diligently

35:33.800 --> 35:35.660
but also have heaven's blessing.

35:35.920 --> 35:37.800
Using tea leaves picked on a rainy day,

35:37.800 --> 35:40.670
even the most fragrant tea
will retain astringency.

35:40.670 --> 35:41.330
What a pity.

35:50.920 --> 35:51.980
Xiuqiong, come in.

36:04.390 --> 36:06.390
On this trip to Mount Guzhu,

36:07.150 --> 36:09.350
I was fortunate to find 20 wild tea trees

36:09.360 --> 36:10.840
in a remote valley.

36:11.960 --> 36:13.400
I also obtained a packet of

36:13.400 --> 36:13.960
the finest wild Zisun Tea

36:13.960 --> 36:15.620
from the mountain villagers,

36:16.680 --> 36:18.540
kept close to my body inside my garment.

36:18.540 --> 36:21.000
I am fortunate
not to have failed my mission.

36:34.760 --> 36:35.670
Excellent tea.

36:42.550 --> 36:43.550
Excellent tea.

36:50.840 --> 36:51.440
Yunyin,

36:52.010 --> 36:53.510
take the remaining tea leaves

36:53.510 --> 36:54.590
to my room later.

36:54.840 --> 36:56.280
Let's see how to handle them.

36:56.280 --> 36:57.340
How to handle them?

36:57.840 --> 36:59.110
We can only discard them.

36:59.110 --> 37:00.000
We're not like some one,

37:00.000 --> 37:01.260
born with a 'tea bone,'

37:01.420 --> 37:03.350
able to identify hundreds of teas,

37:03.920 --> 37:04.630
even resurrect

37:04.630 --> 37:05.760
withered tea trees.

37:06.440 --> 37:07.320
They can also distinguish

37:07.320 --> 37:08.720
good tea leaves' grades.

37:08.920 --> 37:10.250
Better save the effort.

37:10.400 --> 37:11.930
What are you talking about?

37:12.400 --> 37:13.800
Shanbao is your sibling,

37:14.280 --> 37:16.250
who barely escaped death to return.

37:16.250 --> 37:17.460
Instead of saying a few comforting words,

37:17.460 --> 37:18.440
you're making insinuations

37:18.440 --> 37:19.440
with pointed remarks.

37:19.440 --> 37:21.040
Did she owe you in a past life?

37:22.630 --> 37:24.840
Xiangling, are you born with six fingers?

37:24.840 --> 37:26.670
Why are you intervening in
others' affairs?

37:26.670 --> 37:28.030
Our Rong family doesn't serve

37:28.030 --> 37:29.510
pickled vegetables daily.

37:29.510 --> 37:31.510
Why meddle upon opening your mouth?

37:34.800 --> 37:35.480
Yunxi.

37:36.360 --> 37:37.510
I have some Mengding Ganlu Tea

37:37.510 --> 37:38.530
Grandmother rewarded me with.

37:38.530 --> 37:39.730
Come to my place for tea.

37:39.730 --> 37:40.260
Let's go.

37:49.930 --> 37:51.960
Miss Rong, Miss Shen...

37:57.070 --> 37:57.550
I...

37:58.380 --> 37:59.920
Yunshu, go rest early.

38:00.960 --> 38:01.510
Yes.

38:11.190 --> 38:12.990
Born from the same mother as you,

38:13.060 --> 38:14.440
yet siding with

38:14.440 --> 38:15.430
the second and third branches,

38:15.430 --> 38:17.150
constantly undermining you
to please outsiders.

38:17.150 --> 38:18.150
Truly possessed.

38:19.000 --> 38:21.130
Don't I still have you who cares for me?

38:21.290 --> 38:21.820
Let's go.

38:22.360 --> 38:24.090
I'll tell you about my journey.

38:25.320 --> 38:26.450
No time for that now.

38:26.980 --> 38:28.230
Guess why

38:28.230 --> 38:29.490
those door-god-like guards

38:29.490 --> 38:30.490
stayed all night?

38:36.030 --> 38:36.710
Madam.

38:37.360 --> 38:38.360
The people around the Young Master

38:38.360 --> 38:39.630
have been strictly investigated.

38:39.630 --> 38:40.630
The landslide...

38:40.760 --> 38:41.360
He...

38:42.260 --> 38:43.990
doesn't have that capability.

38:44.150 --> 38:45.600
The broken wheel tracks were man-made,

38:45.600 --> 38:47.030
and the landslide was an accident.

38:47.030 --> 38:48.690
But as for the gang of bandits,

38:49.070 --> 38:51.070
should we continue investigating?

38:51.360 --> 38:53.000
Who did it doesn't matter.

38:53.910 --> 38:54.910
What matters is to

38:55.270 --> 38:56.530
see how she handles it.

38:57.480 --> 38:59.280
In moments of crisis and danger,

39:00.230 --> 39:01.990
knowing how to adapt to circumstances

39:01.990 --> 39:03.250
and draw out the enemy.

39:03.880 --> 39:06.510
That shows my years of teaching
weren't in vain.

39:06.510 --> 39:07.970
But as the old saying goes,

39:08.070 --> 39:10.270
"Kindness does not command soldiers."

39:11.260 --> 39:13.320
To become the head of the Rong family,

39:14.430 --> 39:16.400
she still has much to learn.

39:20.400 --> 39:21.630
Miss, be careful.

39:27.960 --> 39:29.290
You're upset,

39:29.510 --> 39:32.020
why take it out on Yunshu
with such strange anger?

39:32.020 --> 39:33.150
Don't blame Yunyin.

39:33.970 --> 39:35.500
It was my own carelessness,

39:35.910 --> 39:38.110
not realizing the tea leaves were poor.

39:54.290 --> 39:56.890
Rain-picked ones
are easy to identify anyway.

39:57.120 --> 39:58.450
How can it be your fault?

40:02.190 --> 40:04.320
It's still because my eyes are no good,

40:04.780 --> 40:07.040
I can only rely on
smell and touch to tell,

40:08.000 --> 40:10.150
ultimately delaying Yunxi's matters.

40:10.150 --> 40:11.400
Doesn't Rong Shanbao

40:11.400 --> 40:13.030
also just need a sniff
to tell good from bad?

40:13.030 --> 40:13.800
You little blind one,

40:13.800 --> 40:15.060
getting delicate now!

40:18.000 --> 40:18.760
After all,

40:19.280 --> 40:21.440
it's all because that gang of robbers
was too greedy.

40:21.440 --> 40:23.440
We had them try to steal the tea seeds

40:23.470 --> 40:25.200
to make Rong Shanbao lose face.

40:25.710 --> 40:26.550
Who knew after taking so much gold,

40:26.550 --> 40:28.280
they still weren't satisfied,

40:28.480 --> 40:30.010
daring to kill and plunder,

40:30.470 --> 40:31.650
causing such a huge disaster!

40:31.650 --> 40:32.130
Shut up!

40:36.130 --> 40:37.150
Didn't we just manage

40:37.150 --> 40:38.150
to cover it up?

40:39.240 --> 40:41.100
Don't mention this matter again.

40:51.730 --> 40:52.550
Each family

40:52.550 --> 40:54.050
has sent
marriage horoscopes.

40:54.050 --> 40:55.580
Yunxi, take a look quickly,

40:55.710 --> 40:57.040
choose a good one early.

40:57.840 --> 40:59.040
Yunyin, don't forget

40:59.500 --> 41:01.230
the best one
is surely reserved

41:01.400 --> 41:03.000
by Grandmother for Shanbao.

41:05.220 --> 41:07.050
Since ancient times, men die for wealth,

41:07.050 --> 41:08.310
and birds die for food.

41:09.000 --> 41:09.800
The Rong family

41:09.800 --> 41:11.530
wants the most excellent heir;

41:11.610 --> 41:12.630
others, likewise,

41:12.630 --> 41:13.890
come for the benefits.

41:14.280 --> 41:15.200
In the end,

41:15.750 --> 41:17.850
what they compete for is not the beauties,

41:17.850 --> 41:19.670
but the tea mountains and silver seas,

41:19.670 --> 41:21.600
and even the Tea King, Rong Family.

41:22.560 --> 41:24.540
[Chunning County Government]

41:30.590 --> 41:31.960
Oh no!

41:32.710 --> 41:33.400
That Xu Song

41:33.710 --> 41:35.440
actually wants to make you die!

41:36.610 --> 41:37.970
It's just a wife-murder case,

41:37.970 --> 41:39.090
how can it endanger my live?

41:39.090 --> 41:41.130
You don't know the severity of this case.

41:41.130 --> 41:42.730
I just checked the old files.

41:42.900 --> 41:44.380
Wei Kejian and his wife, Madam Yang,

41:44.380 --> 41:45.510
were always at odds.

41:45.590 --> 41:46.700
On the 15th day of the first lunar month,

41:46.700 --> 41:48.030
the two had an argument.

41:48.040 --> 41:48.890
What to do?

41:49.530 --> 41:51.190
Madam Yang angrily left home.

41:51.260 --> 41:52.790
Wei Kejian searched in vain

41:52.840 --> 41:54.900
and accused the Yang family
of hiding his wife.

41:54.900 --> 41:56.160
The Yang family counter-accused Wei Kejian

41:56.160 --> 41:57.220
of beating his wife to death.

41:57.220 --> 41:57.900
It's them!

41:57.900 --> 41:59.090
They hid my wife!

42:01.570 --> 42:02.970
With no corpse of Madam Yang found,

42:02.970 --> 42:04.610
Wei Kejian was acquitted and released.

42:04.610 --> 42:05.850
But the Wei and Yang families

42:05.850 --> 42:06.780
became enemies.

42:07.340 --> 42:09.170
Clansmen had several armed clashes,

42:09.170 --> 42:10.430
with many casualties.

42:10.730 --> 42:11.960
In March the following year,

42:11.960 --> 42:13.570
when a beggar
was digging for sweet potatoes,

42:13.570 --> 42:15.570
he unearthed an unidentified body.

42:15.780 --> 42:17.820
Verified by the coroner
using the 'drip bone' method

42:17.820 --> 42:19.700
and identified by the Yang family
through personal effects,

42:19.700 --> 42:20.740
it was indeed the skeleton

42:20.740 --> 42:22.600
of Madam Yang,
missing for a year.

42:22.820 --> 42:23.860
I'm wronged!

42:24.270 --> 42:25.800
Wei Kejian was imprisoned.

42:26.300 --> 42:27.830
It should have ended there.

42:29.380 --> 42:31.260
Why did it later become a doubtful case?

42:31.260 --> 42:32.050
The problem lay with
the presiding judge

42:32.050 --> 42:33.530
at the time, Fan Wende.

42:33.740 --> 42:35.010
Due to sudden heavy rain,

42:35.010 --> 42:36.820
busy repairing collapsed houses,

42:36.820 --> 42:38.820
he delayed the autopsy by three days.

42:38.820 --> 42:40.010
The first examination said female;

42:40.010 --> 42:41.590
another official sent for re-examination,

42:41.590 --> 42:43.050
actually said it was a man.

42:43.340 --> 42:45.220
The bones couldn't even determine gender?

42:45.220 --> 42:46.700
There weren't bones.

42:47.300 --> 42:48.860
Days of heavy rain washed away everything,

42:48.860 --> 42:49.610
leaving only a few

42:49.610 --> 42:51.210
incomplete bone fragments.

42:51.490 --> 42:52.650
Besides jewelry and old belongings,

42:52.650 --> 42:54.250
there was no other evidence.

42:54.570 --> 42:57.100
The Wei family was bankrupted
by the lawsuit.

42:57.610 --> 43:00.010
Wei Kejian even went mad in prison.

43:02.230 --> 43:04.090
The Wei clansmen kept appealing,

43:04.360 --> 43:06.490
cries of injustice lasting for years.

43:06.610 --> 43:08.650
His Majesty issued an edict for a retrial.

43:08.650 --> 43:09.770
However, officials handling the retrial

43:09.770 --> 43:11.170
at best lost their posts,

43:11.330 --> 43:13.520
at worst paid with
their lives and fortunes.

43:13.520 --> 43:15.650
Several are still imprisoned to this day.

43:14.070 --> 43:17.350
[Injustice]

43:17.940 --> 43:19.650
Everyone in officialdom avoids it.

43:19.650 --> 43:20.420
Prefect Xu

43:21.820 --> 43:24.750
is clearly using public office
for private revenge!

43:25.170 --> 43:26.230
Tomorrow morning,

43:26.300 --> 43:28.090
summon everyone involved to court.

43:28.090 --> 43:29.450
I will interrogate them personally.

43:29.450 --> 43:30.490
No way.

43:31.050 --> 43:32.310
The Wei family insists

43:32.530 --> 43:33.610
that on the day of the incident,

43:33.610 --> 43:35.710
Madam Yang attended a banquet
at the Rong family,

43:35.710 --> 43:37.130
to celebrate the Lady Rong's birthday.

43:37.130 --> 43:39.450
She enjoyed lanterns and wine
until night before returning.

43:39.450 --> 43:42.010
They also said she pretended
to attend the banquet but really fled.

43:42.010 --> 43:43.700
Later, she vanished without a trace.

43:43.700 --> 43:45.450
She must have gone to the Rong family.

43:45.450 --> 43:47.980
Then summon the Rong family
for questioning!

43:48.340 --> 43:50.090
It's the number one
tea family in Jiangnan,

43:50.090 --> 43:51.550
the Tea King, Rong family.

43:51.850 --> 43:54.250
How can the government easily summon them?

43:55.450 --> 43:56.850
We'll act on both fronts.

43:56.970 --> 43:58.380
Send someone to Suzhou overnight

43:58.380 --> 43:59.710
to invite Coroner Chen.

43:59.960 --> 44:01.690
He served in the Ministry of Justice
for 60 years.

44:01.690 --> 44:02.940
Even if it's just a few bone fragments,

44:02.940 --> 44:03.900
he can examine them.

44:03.900 --> 44:05.160
Also take my name card,

44:05.450 --> 44:06.940
invite Lady Rong as well.

44:07.530 --> 44:09.130
If she wouldn't like to come,

44:09.170 --> 44:10.500
then bring her by force.

46:53.930 --> 46:56.400
[Zisun Tea]

46:56.430 --> 46:58.340
Grandmother placed great hopes
on your trip.

46:58.340 --> 46:59.700
She hoped for your early return,

46:59.700 --> 47:01.170
wishing for guests
at the New Year tea party

47:01.170 --> 47:02.220
to taste

47:02.220 --> 47:03.490
the wild Zisun Tea.

47:03.970 --> 47:04.780
Zisun Tea,

47:04.780 --> 47:06.940
originates from
Mount Guzhu in Changxing, Zhejiang.

47:06.940 --> 47:08.610
Discovered in the Tang Dynasty
by the Tea Sage Lu Yu

47:08.610 --> 47:10.090
and recommended as tribute tea,

47:10.090 --> 47:12.130
it was presented as tribute
for nearly 1,000 years.

47:12.130 --> 47:14.050
Because its color is purplish
and its shape resembles bamboo shoots,

47:14.050 --> 47:15.300
it is named Zisun Tea.

47:15.650 --> 47:16.970
Lu Yu wrote in The Classic of Tea:

47:16.970 --> 47:18.700
"Purple is superior, green is secondary;

47:18.700 --> 47:20.570
shoot is superior, bud is secondary."

47:20.570 --> 47:22.860
He classified it as top-grade tea,

47:22.890 --> 47:25.020
giving it detailed study and records.

47:25.080 --> 47:26.330
Literary figures like Du Mu, Bai Juyi,

47:26.330 --> 47:27.730
and Su Shi

47:27.780 --> 47:29.170
often praised it in poems and writings,

47:29.170 --> 47:30.510
leaving a legacy for eternity.

47:30.510 --> 47:32.220
Brewing Zisun Tea
with Jinsha spring water

47:32.220 --> 47:33.970
from Mount Guzhu

47:34.380 --> 47:36.730
results in an emerald green color,
orchid fragrance,

47:36.730 --> 47:38.790
sweet taste,
refreshing the mouth, with a rich flavor.

47:38.790 --> 47:39.950
A cup of Zisun Tea

47:40.060 --> 47:41.900
still carries the fragrance
of a thousand years.

47:41.900 --> 47:44.060
Its production technique
is a UNESCO intangible cultural heritage,

47:44.060 --> 47:45.740
and an important component of

47:45.780 --> 47:47.200
China's traditional tea-making techniques

47:47.200 --> 47:48.350
and related customs.
